<title>ITALY: SOCCER-WEAH TO BE UNICEF AMBASSADOR FOR SPORT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WEAH TO BE UNICEF AMBASSADOR FOR SPORT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AC Milan's Liberian striker George Weah will be appointed special representative for sport by the U.N. Children's Fund UNICEF at a ceremony in Milan on Monday, the Gazzetta dello Sport newspaper said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It quoted Weah, world footballer of the year in 1995, as saying in an interview that he would concentrate on raising awareness in two main areas -- children with the AIDS virus and child victims of war.</p>
</text>
